'''Passimian ex''' (Japanese: '''ナゲツケサルex''' ''Nagetukesaru ex'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

